`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/repository/OwnerRepository.java` (interface). The active implementation (profile `spring-data-jpa`) is `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/repository/springdatajpa/SpringDataOwnerRepository.java`. There are also `jpa/JpaOwnerRepositoryImpl.java` and `jdbc/JdbcOwnerRepositoryImpl.java` for other profiles.

Repository methods hit during creation:
- `findByTelephone(String)` — JPQL `SELECT owner FROM Owner owner WHERE owner.telephone = :telephone` (duplicate-phone check).
- `findByLastNameIgnoreCase(String)` — JPQL `... WHERE LOWER(owner.lastName) = LOWER(:lastName)` (household lookup + namesake count).
- `findAll()` — `SELECT owner FROM Owner owner` (used twice: city count, daily count — full-table scans filtered in memory).
- `save(Owner)` — the insert.

